---
import ResearchLayout from "../../layouts/ResearchLayout.astro";
---

<ResearchLayout
  title="先把「事實」與「推論」分開"
  page="P2"
  signal="Evidence"
  evidence="Fact / Inference"
  focus="Fact → Evidence → Inference"
>
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="page-hero-inner">
      <div class="kicker">RESEARCH · VOL.01 · P2</div>
      <h1>先把「事實」與「推論」分開</h1>
      <p>Research Vol.01 的第一個原則：先建立可驗證的事實，再標示研究推論。</p>
    </div>
  </section>
<section class="visual-lead visual-p2" aria-label="P2 visual summary">
  <div class="visual-number">02</div>
  <div class="evidence-stack">
    <div class="evidence-box fact"><span>01</span><strong>FACT</strong><small>可以查證</small></div>
    <div class="evidence-arrow">↓</div>
    <div class="evidence-box evidence"><span>02</span><strong>EVIDENCE</strong><small>找到來源</small></div>
    <div class="evidence-arrow">↓</div>
    <div class="evidence-box inference"><span>03</span><strong>INFERENCE</strong><small>明確標示推論</small></div>
  </div>
  <div class="visual-caption"><span>RESEARCH RULE</span><strong>先把「知道」和「猜測」分開。</strong></div>
</section>


  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">FACT</div>
        <h2>先進製程持續演進</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <article class="card">
      <p>台積電官方 2026 Technology Symposium 涵蓋 3nm、2nm、A16、A14 及後續技術。</p>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="feature">
    <div class="section">
      <div class="section-head">
        <div>
          <div class="kicker">FACT</div>
          <h2>3DFabric 持續擴展</h2>
        </div>
      </div>
      <article class="card">
        <p>官方議程涵蓋 SoIC、InFO、CoWoS 與 SoW 等先進封裝技術。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section">
    <div class="section-head">
      <div>
        <div class="kicker">INFERENCE</div>
        <h2>AI 平台瓶頸正在系統化</h2>
      </div>
    </div>
    <article class="card">
      <p>當製程與封裝同步演進，互連、材料、散熱與電力的重要性也必須放進同一研究框架。</p>
    </article>
  </section>
</ResearchLayout>
